<%! from django.utils.translation import ugettext as _ %>
<%inherit file="base.html"/>

<%block name="css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/new/css/popup.css">
</%block>

<%block name="content">
<!--body content wrap start-->
<div class="main">

<!--hero section start-->
<section class="hero-section" style="background: url('https://media.istockphoto.com/id/1219650284/vector/vpn-secure-connection-concept.jpg?s=612x612&w=0&k=20&c=4J8E7e3J2KNBQv49qJm1iE7yZoWsPf4u8NYvF5Tp8LI=') no-repeat center center / cover; height: 300px;">
</section>
<!--hero section end-->






    <!-- notice start -->
    % if False:
    <div class="notice-wrapper">
      <div class="notice">
        <div class="notice-head">
          <p>제목</p>
        </div>
        <div class="notice-content">
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="notice-btn flex">
          <div class="notice-btn-left"><i class="far fa-check-circle"></i>7일간 열지 않음</div>
          <div class="notice-btn-right">닫기</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    % endif
    <!-- notice end-->

<!--promo section start-->
<section class="promo-section">
  % if LANGUAGE_CODE == 'en':
    <div class="free-txt">
      TITAN currently provides VPNs in IKEV2, OPENVPN, SSTP, and V2RAY modes.<br>
      Currently supported countries are South Korea (KT, SK, LG), Japan, India, and the United States.<br>
      <span class="free-day"> Notice: 1. Please select the V2RAY or OPENVPN mode when you need countries other than South Korea.<br>
      2. If you experience disconnections during WiFi standby mode on iPhones, try using the V2RAY mode.<br></span>
    </div>
  % elif LANGUAGE_CODE == 'zh':
    <div class="free-txt">
      TITAN目前提供IKEV2, OPENVPN, SSTP和V2RAY模式的VPN服务。<br>
      目前支持的国家有韩国(KT, SK, LG), 日本, 印度和美国。<br>
      <span class="free-day"> 公告: 1. 当您需要选择韩国以外的国家时，请选择V2RAY或OPENVPN模式。<br>
      2. 如果您在iPhone上遇到WiFi待机模式下断开连接的问题，请尝试使用V2RAY模式。<br></span>
    </div>
  % else:
    <div class="free-txt">
      타이탄은 현재 IKEV2 와 OPENVPN 및 SSTP, V2RAY방식의 VPN을 제공하고 있습니다.<br>
      현재 지원국가는 한국(KT,SK,LG), 일본, 인도, 미국등을 지원하고 있습니다.<br>
      <span class="free-day"> 공지 : 1.한국외 국가를 원하실때는 V2RAY방식이나 OPENVPN방식을 선택사용하세요.<br>
      2. 아이폰에서 Wifi 대기모드시 끊어짐이 있으신 분들은 V2RAY 방식을 사용해보세요.  <br></span>
    </div>
  % endif
</section>

    <section class="mob-on" style="display: none;">
      <div class="card cur-p" onclick='window.location.href = "/price_table";'>
          <div class="container">
              <div class="row pt20">
                  <div class="col-4">
                    <img class="mobile-i" src="/static/new/img/best-price.png">
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-8">
                    <div class="mobile-tt">
                      ${_('TITAN VPN Price')}
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      ${_('You can check the VPN price at a glance')}
                    </div>
                  </div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card cur-p" onclick='window.location.href = "/download/android";'>
          <div class="container">
              <div class="row pt20">
                  <div class="col-4">
                    <img class="mobile-i" src="/static/new/img/information.png">
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-8">
                    <div class="mobile-tt">
                      ${_('TITAN VPN Download and Manual')}
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      ${_('Read the manual, you can use it easily')}
                    </div>
                  </div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>

    </section>

<!--promo section start-->
<section class="promo-section ptb-20 mob-off">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-10">
                <div class="section-heading mb-5">
                    <span class="badge badge-success badge-pill">${_('Software Download')}</span>
                    <div class="sfd-txt">
                        ${_('Please download the software that corresponds to the platform you are using')}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top: -25px;">
            <div class="col-lg-3 col-sm-6 mb-lg-0">
                <div onclick='window.location.href = "https://titan.jobjapan.com/upload/download/titan.apk"' class="card single-promo-card single-promo-hover mb-lg-0 cur-p">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="pb-2 tac">
                            <img class="idx-di" src="/static/new/img/download/android.png">
                        </div>
                        <div class="tac">
                            <h5 style="margin-bottom: 0px;">${_('Android')}</h5>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 15px; color: red; font-weight: bold;">IKEV2, OPENVPN, V2RAY</p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Private App Store Links')}
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Select apps that will not use VPN')}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-3 col-sm-6">
                <div onclick='window.location.href = "/download/ios"' class="card single-promo-card single-promo-hover mb-lg-0 cur-p">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="pb-2 tac">
                            <img class="idx-di" src="/static/new/img/download/apple-ios.svg">
                        </div>
                        <div class="tac">
                            <h5 style="margin-bottom: 0px;">${_('IOS')}</h5>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 15px; color: red; font-weight: bold;">IKEV2, OPENVPN, V2RAY</p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Auto Select fastest Server')}
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Support In Chinese Iphones')}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-3 col-sm-6">
                <div onclick='window.location.href = "https://titan.jobjapan.com/upload/download/titan.zip"' class="card single-promo-card single-promo-hover mb-lg-0 cur-p">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="pb-2 tac">
                            <img class="idx-di" src="/static/new/img/download/windows.png">
                        </div>
                        <div class="tac">
                            <h5 style="margin-bottom: 0px;">${_('Windows')}</h5>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 15px; color: red; font-weight: bold;">IKEV2,OPENVPN,V2RAY,SSTP</p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Auto Select fastest Server')}
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Support In Chinese Windows')}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-3 col-sm-6">
                <div onclick='window.location.href = "https://titan.jobjapan.com/upload/download/titan.pkg"' class="card single-promo-card single-promo-hover mb-lg-0 cur-p">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="pb-2 tac">
                            <img class="idx-di" src="/static/new/img/download/macos.png">
                        </div>
                        <div class="tac">
                            <h5 style="margin-bottom: 0px;">${_('MacOS')}</h5>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 15px; color: red; font-weight: bold;">IKEV2, OPENVPN, V2RAY</p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Two Versions of MacOS')}
                            </p>
                            <p style="margin-bottom: 3px; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 12px;">
                                ${_('Support In Chinese MacOS')}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<!--promo section end-->

